  "notes": [
    "Addresses are the canonical on-chain deployments. Deposit state, ownership, balances, and readiness are always live chain reads — never copy a status from this file.",
    "bytecodeHash values are keccak256 of the on-chain deployed bytecode, re-checked on chain 4663.",
    "VaultLegalReadinessRegistry is a predecessor deposit gate, SUPERSEDED as the factory's active gate by VaultDepositReadinessRegistry; it remains live on-chain but is no longer consulted.",
    "VaultDepositReadinessRegistry is the active deposit-readiness gate and ships CLOSED (defaultReady=false, zero vaults marked ready).",
    "HissLpManagerV1 (Stock-Premium LP manager) LAUNCHED PAUSED as its immutable initial state; the owner-gated Safe unpause has since executed on-chain, so its pause state is never assumed — current paused()/feeBps()/owner()/treasury() are always live chain reads (unknown on a failed read, never inferred). Its management fee applies to realized LP fees only (feeBps 500, immutable MAX_FEE_BPS 500). Unpaused alone opens nothing: enrollment and every managed action stay owner/beneficiary-gated.",
    "V2 (24/7 request-queue) contracts: HissUsdGVaultV2 is the CANONICAL new-deposit vault; deposits and USDG redemptions route through HissRequestQueue and settle in epoch batches via HissBatchSettler. The V2 contracts are not yet source-verified on Blockscout; their sourceVerification is 'source-matched: frozen RC v2-rc-frozen-1d5299f' (live runtime bytecode keccak-checked against the frozen release candidate build). deploymentTx/block values are the creation transactions indexed by Blockscout, re-confirmed via eth_getTransactionReceipt on the public RPC.",
    "Vault capacity is computed from current onchain liveness evidence. When liveness evidence expires, execution capacity fails closed until refreshed."
  ],
